ields,\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\nodes\\_otr_slot_drama_contract.py:388: # the technical slot (see make_constrained_generate_fn call site).\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\nodes\\_otr_stage1_plan.py:561: function (rather than calling Stage1Plan.model_json_schema()\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\nodes\\_otr_stage1_plan.py:566: return Stage1Plan.model_json_schema()\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\nodes\\_otr_story_brief.py:758: # Sprint 2C: typed repair-prompt factories. run_story_brief_reflection\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\nodes\\_otr_story_brief.py:764: from ._otr_repair_prompts import make_dispatching_repair_factory\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\nodes\\_otr_story_brief.py:766: from _otr_repair_prompts import make_dispatching_repair_factory  # type: ignore\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\nodes\\_otr_story_brief.py:885: 3-attempt retry ladder (base -> structural retry -> typed repair).\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\nodes\\_otr_story_brief.py:928: repair_prompt_factory=make_dispatching_repair_factory(),\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\nodes\\_otr_story_brief.py:1202: repair_prompt_factory=make_dispatching_repair_factory(),\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\nodes\\_otr_story_brief.py:1405: repair_prompt_factory=make_dispatching_repair_factory(),\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\nodes\\_otr_story_critic.py:32: 3-attempt retry ladder (base -> structural retry -> typed repair).\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\nodes\\_otr_story_cr